        "original_id": "f1696457-80c2-5cff-ae7c-a41159f346be",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Annette Bening, Howard Deutch, John Hughes, Dan Aykroyd, John Candy, Stephanie Faracy\n- Works: The Great Outdoors, The Grifters, American Beauty, Being Julia, The Kids Are All Right\n- Awards: Academy Awards, Hollywood Walk of Fame\n\nFacts:\n- Annette Carol Bening was born on May 29, 1958, and she is an American actress.\n- The Great Outdoors is a 1988 American comedy film directed by Howard Deutch and written and produced by John Hughes.\n- The Great Outdoors stars Dan Aykroyd, John Candy, Stephanie Faracy, and Annette Bening in her film debut.\n- Annette Bening received an Academy Award nomination for The Grifters in 1990.\n- Annette Bening received an Academy Award nomination for American Beauty in 1999.\n- Annette Bening received a star on the Hollywood Walk of Fame in 2006.\n- Annette Bening received an Academy Award nomination for Being Julia in 2004.\n- Annette Bening received an Academy Award nomination for The Kids Are All Right in 2010.",
